OL,3,GNEWSAHunt for RAF base ghosts leads to
OL,4,Alost BBC tape
OL,5,
OL,6,FInvestigators of ghost stories don't
OL,7,Fusually find exactly what they're
OL,8,Fsearching for.
OL,10,FBut writer Paul Lee, from King's Lynn
OL,11,Fin Norfolk, struck lucky when he
OL,12,Funearthed lost footage investigating
OL,13,Fhauntings at the former RAF air station
OL,14,Fat Bircham Newton.
OL,16,FFrom sightings of ghostly figures in
OL,17,FRAF uniforms to the sound of squash
OL,18,Fgames on empty courts, stories of the
OL,19,Fsupposed hauntings had been told for
OL,20,Fdecades.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
