OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHunt for RAF base ghosts leads to
OL,4,Alost BBC tape
OL,5,
OL,6,FLee had heard of a BBC television
OL,7,Freport on the subject that was
OL,8,Fbroadcast over half a century ago.
OL,9,FDespite the BBC no longer holding a
OL,10,Fcopy, Lee unexpectedly found the
OL,11,Ffootage after delving through the
OL,12,Farchives at the British Film Institute.
